1000 BM$="They were scheduled to rest one night at the Hilton Hotel in Paris, and\travel by charter bus the following day. Thus, David decided to call it a\day early.":GOSUB 5100
1005 GOSUB 6410
1010 BM$="He took some sleeping pills and laid on the bed, but between what happened\in London and the upcoming concerts in France, David had trouble falling\asleep.":GOSUB 5100
1020 '
1030 BM$="The sleeping pills made him drowsy, but after a while he couldn't bear\staying in bed.":GOSUB 5100
1040 BM$="Instead, he decided to go outside and enjoy the night in Paris.":GOSUB 5100
1045 COMMON FOF:GOSUB 6400
1050 BM$="He entered one of the taxis in front of the hotel.":GOSUB 5100:GOSUB 9520:GOSUB 9500
1055 GOSUB 6430
1060 GOSUB 9550:BM$="Driver: Where to?":GOSUB 5100
1070 BM$="Without a clear destination in mind, David quickly started thinking of\famous landmarks.":GOSUB 5100
1100 '
