1900 '
1910 BM$="Driver: The Arch of Triumph? Sure thing.":GOSUB 5100:GOSUB 9530
1920 GOSUB 6190
1950 IF A4=1 THEN GOSUB 4600:GOTO 2060
1960  A4=1:BM$="Driver: This is the Arch of Triumph's square, but I think you'd enjoy\walking through the Champs-Elysees. Anyway, here we are.":GOSUB 5100
1970 BM$="David looked over the roundabout of Place de l'Etoile, the square\surrounding the Arch of Triumph. He felt somewhat overwhelmed by all\the roads linking together.":GOSUB 5100
1980 BM$="He considered going to the Champs-Elysees, but he didn't feel like walking\with all those cars coming and going so close by.":GOSUB 5100
2050 GOSUB 4500
