2070 IF CN=1 THEN 1300:'
2080 IF CN=2 THEN 2500:'
2090 IF CN=3 THEN 2700:'
2100 '
2110 BM$="Driver: The Notre Dame Cathedral? Sure thing.":GOSUB 5100:GOSUB 9530
2120 GOSUB 6220
2150 IF A6=1 THEN GOSUB 4600:GOTO 2260
2160  A6=1:BM$="The taxi crossed the Seine and left David at the Notre Dame square. It was\full of tourists and couples.":GOSUB 5100
2170 BM$="The cathedral is one of the most famous landmarks in all of France.\At first David was captivated by its beauty, but after a while he could feel\something mystical... Ancient sadness and hatred... He had to leave soon.":GOSUB 5100
2250 GOSUB 4500
