4500 BM$="David wanted to see another landmark. He stopped another taxi.":GOSUB 5100
4510 GOSUB 6430:GOSUB 9550:BM$="Driver: Where to?":GOSUB 5100
4520 BM$="David considered his options.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
4600 BM$="Driver: Here we are, chief. Is this it, or do you want me to take you\somewhere else?":GOSUB 5100
4610 BM$="David looked out of the window. He had already been there... It felt like one\of his nightmares.\He decided to go somewhere else.":GOSUB 5100:GOSUB 6430:RETURN
4620 '
4630 BM$="The taxi drove along Paris, headed towards David's destination.":GOSUB 5000:RETURN
4640 BM$="David looked at the night scenery of Paris flowing from the taxi's window.":GOSUB 5000:RETURN
